{"schemaVersion": "svg-plan-ledger-v1", "source": {"exam": "archive/exams/textbooks/미래엔_대수/미래엔_대수_삼각함수_대단원마무리_고2/미래엔_대수_삼각함수_대단원마무리_고2.js", "sourceOrdinal": 9, "sourceId": 9, "sourceCommit": "35f3023d736d4785de04846605ed5bbbb315425e", "sourceBlobSha": "588684bd03b8c7146b0e3e1ddfd5a8ead0cde533"}, "scope": "textbooks", "existing": {"inventoryStatus": "INVENTORIED", "problemAssets": [], "solutionAssets": [], "checkedCommit": "35f3023d736d4785de04846605ed5bbbb315425e", "visualReview": "NO_ASSET_REFERENCES", "missingAssets": []}, "need": {"problem": "NOT_REQUIRED", "solution": "FIGURE", "why": "t=cosx∈[-1,1]에서y=−2t²+t+2. 꼭짓점t1/4에서M17/8,끝점t−1에서m−1(반대끝은1). 정답M+m=9/8. 표시식x는t이다."}, "plan": {"decisionPath": "docs/plans/archive-one-route-upgrade/svg-plans-expanded/textbooks/미래엔_대수/미래엔_대수_삼각함수_대단원마무리_고2/미래엔_대수_삼각함수_대단원마무리_고2/_decisions.jsonl", "files": ["q09-solution.json"], "capability": "piecewise-polynomial-spike-v1", "status": "PLAN_WRITTEN", "render": "NOT_RUN"}, "pedagogy": {"decisiveRelation": "t=cosx∈[-1,1]에서y=−2t²+t+2. 꼭짓점t1/4에서M17/8,끝점t−1에서m−1(반대끝은1). 정답M+m=9/8. 표시식x는t이다.", "sourceEvidence": "함수 $y=-2\\cos^2 x + \\cos x + 2$의 최댓값을 $M$, 최솟값을 $m$이라 할 때, $M+m$의 값을 구하시오.", "hiddenAnswerValues": []}, "checks": {"answerHidden": false, "solutionAnswerShown": true, "midValuesKept": true, "coordsVerified": true, "captionNamesPresent": true, "existingVisualReviewed": null, "newPlanVisualReviewed": false}, "publication": {"state": "UNVERIFIED", "evidence": "새 실제 렌더 집 PC 담당 NOT_RUN"}}
{"schemaVersion": "svg-plan-ledger-v1", "source": {"exam": "archive/exams/textbooks/미래엔_대수/미래엔_대수_삼각함수_대단원마무리_고2/미래엔_대수_삼각함수_대단원마무리_고2.js", "sourceOrdinal": 10, "sourceId": 10, "sourceCommit": "35f3023d736d4785de04846605ed5bbbb315425e", "sourceBlobSha": "588684bd03b8c7146b0e3e1ddfd5a8ead0cde533"}, "scope": "textbooks", "existing": {"inventoryStatus": "INVENTORIED", "problemAssets": [], "solutionAssets": [], "checkedCommit": "35f3023d736d4785de04846605ed5bbbb315425e", "visualReview": "NO_ASSET_REFERENCES", "missingAssets": []}, "need": {"problem": "NOT_REQUIRED", "solution": "FIGURE", "why": "원문0≤x<5π/2에서sinx=3/4의교점은3개다. 첫근α는(0,π/2),β=π−α,γ=2π+α이므로(β+γ)/2=3π/2. cos(α+3π/2)=sinα=3/4. 원래각축을그대로쓰고세교점을임의근사유리수로바꾸지않는다. 정답3/4."}, "plan": {"decisionPath": "docs/plans/archive-one-route-upgrade/svg-plans-expanded/textbooks/미래엔_대수/미래엔_대수_삼각함수_대단원마무리_고2/미래엔_대수_삼각함수_대단원마무리_고2/_decisions.jsonl", "files": ["q10-solution.json"], "capability": "trigonometric-spike-v1", "status": "PLAN_WRITTEN", "render": "NOT_RUN"}, "pedagogy": {"decisiveRelation": "원문0≤x<5π/2에서sinx=3/4의교점은3개다. 첫근α는(0,π/2),β=π−α,γ=2π+α이므로(β+γ)/2=3π/2. cos(α+3π/2)=sinα=3/4. 원래각축을그대로쓰고세교점을임의근사유리수로바꾸지않는다. 정답3/4.", "sourceEvidence": "$0 \\le x < \\frac{5}{2}\\pi$일 때, 방정식 $4\\sin x = 3$을 만족시키는 $x$의 값을 작은 것부터 차례대로 $\\alpha,\\, \\beta,\\, \\gamma$라 하자. 이때 $\\cos\\left(\\alpha + \\frac{\\beta+\\gamma}{2}\\right)$의 값을 구하시오.", "hiddenAnswerValues": []}, "checks": {"answerHidden": false, "solutionAnswerShown": true, "midValuesKept": true, "coordsVerified": true, "captionNamesPresent": true, "existingVisualReviewed": null, "newPlanVisualReviewed": false}, "publication": {"state": "UNVERIFIED", "evidence": "새 실제 렌더 집 PC 담당 NOT_RUN"}}
